In public/css/style.css: (1) Remove the '.load-more { display: block; margin: 16px auto; }' rule at lines 877-880. (2) After the .empty-state block, add the following CSS block:

/* ─── Infinite Scroll Sentinel ─── */
.load-more-sentinel {
  height: 48px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.sentinel-spinner {
  width: 24px;
  height: 24px;
  border: 2px solid var(--border);
  border-top-color: var(--primary);
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: spinnerRotate 0.8s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes spinnerRotate {
  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}

In public/js/history.js, make the following changes:

1. REMOVE line 3: `const loadMoreBtn = document.getElementById('loadMoreBtn');`

2. ADD after `let unsubscribeLive = null;` (line 10):
   `let scrollObserver = null;`

3. ADD sentinel reference and helper functions after the PAGE_SIZE constant:
   ```
   const sentinel = document.getElementById('loadMoreSentinel');

   function showSentinelSpinner() {
     sentinel.innerHTML = '<div class="sentinel-spinner"></div>';
   }

   function clearSentinelSpinner() {
     sentinel.innerHTML = '';
   }
   ```

4. MODIFY initHistory(user) to disconnect and re-create the observer:
   - After `historyList.innerHTML = '';`, add:
   ```
   if (scrollObserver) { scrollObserver.disconnect(); scrollObserver = null; }
   clearSentinelSpinner();
   ```
   - After the `loadPage(user)` call, add observer setup:
   ```
   scrollObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
     if (entries[0].isIntersecting && !loading && hasMore) {
       loadPage(currentUser);
     }
   }, { rootMargin: '0px 0px 120px 0px' });
   scrollObserver.observe(sentinel);
   ```

5. MODIFY loadPage(user):
   - Replace `loadMoreBtn.textContent = 'Loading...';` → `showSentinelSpinner();`
   - Remove `loadMoreBtn.classList.add('hidden');` (inside if hasMore=false block)
   - Replace `loadMoreBtn.classList.remove('hidden');` → (nothing needed — observer keeps watching)
   - Replace `loadMoreBtn.textContent = 'Load More';` (end of function, line 136) → `clearSentinelSpinner();`
   - When `hasMore` becomes false (inside the if block), add: `if (scrollObserver) scrollObserver.unobserve(sentinel);`

6. MODIFY renderHistory():
   - Remove `loadMoreBtn.classList.add('hidden');` (in the filtered.length===0 block, line 176)

7. REMOVE lines 139-141: the `loadMoreBtn.addEventListener('click', ...)` block entirely.
